node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# package-lock.json is deliberately NOT committed yet — it is a real decision,
# not an oversight. The Dockerfile does `COPY package*.json ./`, and that glob
# MATCHES a lockfile: committing one changes what `npm install` resolves inside
# the image. Every dependency in package.json is currently pinned to "*", so
# adding a lock would be the first time the container build became reproducible
# — a genuine improvement, but a behavioural change to a live build. Decide it
# on purpose, then delete this block.
package-lock.json
